abstract: "Laboratory execution host for Culsma programs, with persistent scheduling, external device plugins, evidence-aware material registration, station resource ownership, and conservative recovery of uncertain execution outcomes. Version 0.1.1 is an experimental source preview validated with restricted simulator profiles."
